<title>POLAND: ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 64.</title>
<headline>ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 64.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 18,300 shares in Echo SA at 64 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Echo fell 2.3 percent to 65 zlotys in 7,185 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
